{"title": "Shackled (Condition)", "pageid": 26675, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shackled_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shackled Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Shackled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Shackled</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Chained to the ground with iron shackles </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_GOBLINPRIEST_CHAINS</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOB_GOBLINPRIEST_CHAINS%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOB_GOBLINPRIEST_CHAINS%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Helpable_Condition\" title=\"SG Helpable Condition\">SG_Helpable_Condition</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Applied to the player if they are chained up by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/38px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/50px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Priestess Gut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Priestess Gut</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.</li>\n<li>Also applied to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/25px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/38px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/50px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valeria\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/25px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\">Valeria</a> when captured and chained up by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrai